<template><article class="legal-page container"><h1>California Notice at Collection</h1><h2>California Notice at Collection</h2><p><em>Effective Date:</em> January 8, 2025</p><p><a href="/storage/KTnqzJk9byuXcgddDY4XhziEkVABnUltsgcvjvla.pdf">Download PDF Copy</a></p><hr><p>This Notice at Collection (“Notice”) applies to California residents and describes how kohlerackels, Riley &amp; Scarborough LLP and its affiliated businesses (collectively, “Kohlerackels”) collect, use, and retain information that relates to California residents (“Personal Information”).</p><p>For more information about our information practices, please visit our Privacy Policy. If you have a disability that prevents or limits your ability to access this notice, please contact us at 1.800.237.2000 or <a href="mailto:info@kohlerackels.com">info@kohlerackels.com</a>. We will work with you to provide this Notice in an alternative format.</p><h3>Personal Information We Collect</h3><p>The types of Personal Information we collect about you depend on how you interact with us.</p><p><strong>a) Information You Voluntarily Provide to Kohlerackels.</strong> We collect Personal Information that you voluntarily provide to us when contacting us, requesting updates or newsletters, registering for events, filling out a form, responding to a survey, submitting a message, asking to be contacted, or otherwise communicating with us.</p><p><strong>Identifiers.</strong> Name, physical address, email address, telephone number, signature, government-issued identification numbers, account credentials and similar identifiers.</p><p><strong>Demographic Information.</strong> Information that may include protected classifications such as age, gender, race, or national origin.</p><p><strong>Professional and Educational Information.</strong> Employers, job title, professional qualifications, education, degrees, institutions, memberships, qualifications and certifications.</p><h3>How We Use Personal Information</h3><p>We use Personal Information to provide access to Services, respond to requests, send communications, personalize experiences, conduct research and analysis, support marketing where permitted, operate and improve our business, and for legal, fraud-prevention and safety purposes.</p><h3>Retention of Personal Information</h3><p>We retain Personal Information for the period necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Notice unless a longer period is required or permitted by law.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>For questions, comments or inquiries regarding the collection, processing and storage of Personal Information, contact <a href="mailto:info@kohlerackels.com">info@kohlerackels.com</a> or 1.800.237.2000.</p></article></template>

